@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Add a ``stats_hook`` option to ``Retrying``, ``AsyncRetrying`` and
+    ``@retry``. When set, it is called with the statistics dict after every
+    attempt, including the last one. Errors raised by the hook are logged at
+    debug level and ignored.
